<title>USA: TRC Cos to buy back up to 500,000 shares.</title>
<headline>TRC Cos to buy back up to 500,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>WINDSOR, Conn. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>TRC Cos Inc said Monday it plans to buy back up to an additional 500,000 shares of its common stock, a program it believes will be accretive to earnings.</p>
<p>The company already has repurchased 400,500 shares under a buyback plan adopted in February that authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The additional 500,000 shares represent about 7 percent of the company's outstanding common stock, it said. The actual number of additional shares repurhcased will depend on prevailing market conditions, it said.</p>
